(constants-cg)
*title Constants and center-of-gravity coupling
*atmos standard
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=10000 long=0 lat=0 vel=500 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 wt=1500
  *file cg.dat time wt cg mach ca vel
  *segment 1 trim
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05
    *constants config=2
    *cg cg=(weight-cg)
    *aero ca=(cg-sensitive-ca)
    *fly alpha=0
    *fly betae=0
    *fly bankgd=0
    *when time=5 stop
*end
